Image optimization
------------------
The application does not use next/image. Next.js image optimization is
disabled in apps/web/next.config.ts; the web Docker build excludes the
sharp and @img/sharp-* packages from its generated standalone runtime.
The npm build installation still contains those packages, and its collected
license files may include their notices. They are not shipped as executable
packages in the web runtime image.

Other image contents
